Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 00:58:12 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1147/1252] HERESY 1167: the Creator as a kitchen (a draft for
 Viktor's eye)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 05.10.2026: «Левую промптинг генерации на 2/3 слева как основную,
разделить её на две колонки по 1/3, всё пересмотреть и реорганизовать.
Статистику/карту трека реально нужно на 1/3 ширины справа… [дубли] во втором
фрейме 1/3 ширины вниз этого фрейма под-фреймом. И для экономии пространства
карточки сделать более компактными… Каждую секцию отчётливо обособить, может
даже едва заметным карточным абажуром. Схлопнутые блоки… более контрастно».

- The form regrouped into two columns of cards, no field changed: the words
  (the song with the Writer's document, the style, the lyrics) and the machine
  (the profile, the plan and the seeds, the sound, the adapters, the drawers).
- From 1600 px the two stand side by side over two thirds of the room; the
  last third is the take over its takes, a line between them to drag (Home or
  a double-click for the default, arrows; kept as a share of the height), the
  takes in compact cards of two lines, folded to one bar under the take.
- Below 1600 px the three columns and their grips as before, the cards in one.
- Closed reads as closed: folded parts, closed drawers and the new «Add a LoRA»
  line (every adapter not in use behind it, remembered open or closed) stand on
  a firmer ground with the chevron in the accent; the drawers two by two.
- A tip reached by the keyboard stays while the pointer only passes (the
  kitchen scrolls under a still pointer when a field takes the focus).
- Three keys in the six catalogs.

On the branch creator-1167, served on :41994 for his eye; the live page is not
touched. The page suite 329/0 (the grips at 1599 px, the kitchen at 1920),
languages 14/0, player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
